sequenceDiagram
accTitle: A replica supplies compute for DocumentDB failover
accDescr: After the primary fails, an existing replica in another Availability Zone is promoted. The application reconnects through the cluster endpoint, while replicated storage alone would not provide replacement compute.
participant A as Java application
participant E as Cluster endpoint
participant P as Primary, AZ A
participant R as Replica, AZ B
A->>E: Open database connection
E-->>A: Resolve current primary
A->>P: Database requests
Note over P: Primary or AZ A fails
Note over R: DocumentDB promotes existing replica
A->>E: Refresh resolution and reconnect
E-->>A: Resolve promoted primary
A->>R: Retry database requests
R-->>A: Resume service
Note over P,R: Shared durable storage does not replace replica compute
